.TH Y5.COMPOSITOR 1 "July 2026" "y5" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
y5.compositor \- Y5 Wayland compositor (DRM/KMS session)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B y5.compositor
.RI [ \-\-config\-file= PATH ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B y5.compositor
is a Wayland compositor with a pannable, zoomable desktop and built-in
screen capture. It runs directly on DRM/KMS and is normally started
through the \fBY5 Compositor\fR entry of a display manager, which invokes
the session wrapper
.IR /usr/libexec/y5\-compositor/session ,
not by running this binary manually.
.PP
All configuration is read once at startup from a single JSON file in
which every field is required; the compositor refuses to start if the
file is missing or incomplete. On the first session start the wrapper
seeds a complete default file automatically.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-config\-file= PATH
Read the configuration from
.I PATH
instead of the default location.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/y5.compositor/settings.json
Per-user configuration, honouring
.BR XDG_CONFIG_HOME .
Edit with
.BR y5.compositor.settings (1).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR y5.compositor.settings (1),
.BR y5.compositor.monitor (1),
.BR xwayland\-satellite (1)
